  ],
  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Five powerful earthquakes.",
      "start": 0.25,
      "end": 1.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Nine days.",
      "start": 1.581,
      "end": 2.38
    },
    {
      "text": "And Vanuatu is still shaking.",
      "start": 2.63,
      "end": 4.046
    },
    {
      "text": "It began October nineteenth,",
      "start": 4.086,
      "end": 5.885
    },
    {
      "text": "with a magnitude six point zero.",
      "start": 5.885,
      "end": 7.603
    },
    {
      "text": "A six point three followed the",
      "start": 7.643,
      "end": 8.998
    },
    {
      "text": "next day.",
      "start": 8.998,
      "end": 9.474
    },
    {
      "text": "On October twenty-fourth,",
      "start": 9.514,
      "end": 10.794
    },
    {
      "text": "a six point nine,",
      "start": 10.794,
      "end": 11.83
    },
    {
      "text": "then a six point three minutes later.",
      "start": 11.83,
      "end": 13.606
    },
    {
      "text": "And on October twenty-eighth,",
      "start": 13.646,
      "end": 15.024
    },
    {
      "text": "the latest: another six point zero.",
      "start": 15.024,
      "end": 16.963
    },
    {
      "text": "Why so much?",
      "start": 17.003,
      "end": 17.844
    },
    {
      "text": "Vanuatu sits where the Australian plate",
      "start": 17.925,
      "end": 19.839
    },
    {
      "text": "dives beneath the Pacific plate.",
      "start": 19.839,
      "end": 21.312
    },
    {
      "text": "That slow collision loads faults with stress",
      "start": 21.352,
      "end": 23.524
    },
    {
      "text": "until they slip.",
      "start": 23.524,
      "end": 24.291
    },
    {
      "text": "That same collision built Vanuatu's chain of",
      "start": 24.331,
      "end": 26.937
    },
    {
      "text": "volcanic islands.",
      "start": 26.937,
      "end": 27.949
    },
    {
      "text": "This one patch had five in",
      "start": 28.399,
      "end": 29.889
    },
    {
      "text": "nine days.",
      "start": 29.889,
      "end": 30.549
    }
  ],
  "narrationStart": 0.25,
  "narrationEnd": 30.549,
